scenario: BT-PAIR-02
title: Bluetooth of the Mac mini and phone sound in
area: Bluetooth
rows: F-NET-11, F-NET-24
machines: mac mini
needs: person
prereq: A phone with Bluetooth and music.
step: Open Settings, Bluetooth on the Mac mini.
expect: The adapter is detected with an address and can be switched on.
clause: F-NET-11.adapter
step: On the phone, search for Bluetooth devices and choose the Mac mini by name; accept the pairing on both.
expect: The phone shows connected.
clause: F-NET-24.pair
step: Play music on the phone.
expect: You hear it from the Mac mini's output, clear and in time.
clause: F-NET-24.sound
